OL,3,GNEWSAAirport workers spat at and
OL,4,Aracially abused - union
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at London Stansted Airport have
OL,7,Freported being spat at, assaulted and
OL,8,Fracially abused, according to a trade
OL,9,Funion.
OL,11,FThe scale of harm was uncovered in a
OL,12,Fsurvey by Unite, which found 82% of
OL,13,Fworkers at the Essex terminal were
OL,14,Fabused at least once a month.
OL,16,FAlcohol was the biggest trigger for
OL,17,Fabuse, followed by flight delays and
OL,18,Fbaggage issues.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
